  "paper_id": "ccs-2025-the-challenges-and-opportunities-with-cybersecurity-regu-51c6d902",
  "title": "The Challenges and Opportunities with Cybersecurity Regulations: A Case Study of the US Electric Power Sector",
  "abstract": "In various industries, cybersecurity regulations have been enacted in an effort to drive improvements to organizational security postures. Despite the prominent influence of these regulations, there has been limited prior investigation of how organizations engage with these regulations and the challenges that they face. Assessing these factors is vital for understanding the impact of cybersecurity regulations in practice and how to enhance them moving forward.",
